.TH POINT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Point \- A 2D point in float pixels
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtypes.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef SDL_FPoint  Point;     /* { float x, y } */
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A 2D point in float pixels. Rarely needed by games, which use Vec2 from mathx.h for positions; Point exists for the few SDL calls that want it.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B x
horizontal
.TP
.B y
vertical
.SH MODULE
types (src/engine/types/types.h)
